ass=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T08:58:01-07:00","id":1213447,"title":"","content":"I'm sort of trying to but my player group is... disparate, to say the least, and difficult to get together to do anything on a schedule lately. I'm not pushing them too hard, though. I'm kinda tired of being the only person who runs games out of everyone I know anyway so I'm using this as a break.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5771-krata-lightblade","name":"Krata Lightblade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5771_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"72"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T09:05:24-07:00","id":1213450,"title":"","content":"I was thinking of starting up a sandbox game for dragonblooded on rpol, but ive been pretty busy with rl things (new job, moving to new job)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/701-omniplex","name":"Omniplex","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T18:02:38-07:00","id":1213617,"title":"","content":"I intend to run a just-hatched DB game set in the House of Bells, name pending. I intend for it to be a silly, short game, rather than anything super serious. Something that would probably end at E2 or once a story has passed, whichever is longer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24165-parabola","name":"Parabola","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24165_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T19:22:36-07:00","id":1213635,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1212981-so-now-that-we-have-a-dragonblooded-character-creation?p=1213361#post1213361\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I might be running a game for some people at work who have never played an RPG before. One of them made such an awesome character concept that I'm actively excited to be working with inexperienced players as a result.</div> </div> </div> </div>Would it be okay to share the concept? I'm always excited to hear new inspirations!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-30T22:31:56-07:00","id":1213678,"title":"","content":"I may start taking notes on running a Heptagram game, but I am deep into a Solar game right now that I am loving.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>May you live in interesting times...</i><br /> <br /> Storyteller of <b><a href=\"https://sunforgedoath.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Sun Forged Oath</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1998-keichiokami","name":"Keichiokami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1998_4.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-01T01:04:25-07:00","id":1213696,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Keichiokami</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1212981-so-now-that-we-have-a-dragonblooded-character-creation?p=1213678#post1213678\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I may start taking notes on running a Heptagram game, but I am deep into a Solar game right now that I am loving.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GTXBLyp7_Dw\" target=\"_blank\">Dnn, dnn dnn dnn, dnn dnn dnnnnnn</a><br /> <br /> But seriously, tell me if you run that, sounds like fun","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23635-lion-hamster","name":"Lion Hamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23635_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-01T02:47:05-07:00","id":1213712,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1212981-so-now-that-we-have-a-dragonblooded-character-creation?p=1213635#post1213635\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Would it be okay to share the concept? I'm always excited to hear new inspirations!</div> </div> </div> </div>House Cathak Logistics Officer/Baker who shapes earth ovens out the ground then cooks with firebending. Has the sobriquet &quot;Mother of Legions&quot; for the impact she's had on morale.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T00:35:50-07:00","id":1214071,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lion Hamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1212981-so-now-that-we-have-a-dragonblooded-character-creation?p=1213696#post1213696\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GTXBLyp7_Dw\" target=\"_blank\">Dnn, dnn dnn dnn, dnn dnn dnnnnnn</a><br /> <br /> But seriously, tell me if you run that, sounds like fun</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Oh I sure will! I honestly have wanted to run one since First Edition but I have never had the right combination of players to make it happen. I also really like running Solar Exalted Chronicles. if I run a Heptagram game it will most likely be a &quot;historical&quot; piece that will take place during the Reign of the Scarlet Empress Era.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>May you live in interesting times...</i><br /> <br /> Storyteller of <b><a href=\"https://sunforgedoath.obsidianportal.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Sun Forged Oath</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1998-keichiokami","name":"Keichiokami","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1998_4.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T03:27:25-07:00","id":1214091,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Keichiokami</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1212981-so-now-that-we-have-a-dragonblooded-character-creation?p=1214071#post1214071\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Oh I sure will! I honestly have wanted to run one since First Edition but I have never had the right combination of players to make it happen. I also really like running Solar Exalted Chronicles. if I run a Heptagram game it will most likely be a &quot;historical&quot; piece that will take place during the Reign of the Scarlet Empress Era.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ohh? Innnnnnteresting","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23635-lion-hamster","name":"Lion Hamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23635_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"89"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-02T08:19:40-07:00","id":1214168,"title":"","content":"We have a giant Water-Aspected V'neef (as in, a V'neef with the Giant Merit) who seems poised to become a merchant/privateer, a Wood-Aspect Sesus practicing being underestimated for the day he becomes a spymaster, a Fire-Aspected Cynis who is massively in debt to the Sesus' family (actually just a coverstory), and a nerd Wind-Aspected Regara who's more scholar and sorceror than banker.<br /> We are all out of alignment with our Houses' Aspects, on a trip to the West after graduating from the Spiral Academy, and <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">the very best of friends</div></div> </div> </div>. We swore an oath of Brotherhood to settle an island we 'inherited' Dunzlzhan-style from a powerful Outcaste (as in, the four of us solved a riddle and got an island out of it, jointly). This..... confuses our matriarchs, but they want each of us to head over there and get things figured out before they play political hot potato with it. The V'neef acts as captain and purser (and got the crew together), the Cynis brought the ship and luxuries, the Sesus 'bought' the ship and got some supplies, and the nerd Regara is bringing his nerdbarn toadies to make sure the Outcaste didn't trap the living daylights out the island... which he, no doubt, did.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I used to know things. Forbidden things.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/306-brasstreader","name":"Brasstreader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar306_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}